h1: A Recovery Man's Guide to Buying a Reliable Car
lede: If you want to know which cars break down most, don't ask the salesman. Ask the person driving the recovery truck. At Faster we load up cars that have given up on the road every week. This is what we see, make by make, and what we'd buy ourselves.
